[TITLE]
IO-25: HEC-22 Example 4-9 (curb opening inlet in a depressed gutter) on two
identical streets. Street A enters the 1-inch gutter depression as 0.0833
(feet, as the engine reads it and as EPA's street_curb_inlet_9a-CFS.inp does);
street B enters it as 1 (inches, as the input reference says).
HEC-22 answer for the depressed gutter: 1.55 cfs captured of 1.77 cfs.

